{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"518e9061-ed9f-42d1-ae44-cf5200aee6c8":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"fd35310f-a903-4f2a-aa78-92f345583144":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/account\/login"}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_MAmPAM":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"97ce63d9-5477-4fed-a92a-335ffa45b484":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"recommended_products_xL8FAn":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"The Perfect Gifting","content":"","button_text":"","product_list":["sweet-treats-gift-box","strawberry-cream-tini-bundle"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Our <a href=\"\/products\/tough-nut\" title=\"Tough Nut\"><em>Tough Nut<\/em><\/a> has been our bestselling flavour for some time now. Tough Nut Cream takes everything you loved about our fan favourite flavour and reimagines it in a luxurious and rich cream liqueur. The taste of real hazelnuts comes together with fine notes of vanilla and caramel and creates a taste experience of pure bliss! Discover  <em><strong>Tough Nut Cream <\/strong><\/em><em>now<\/em>.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs,<\/a> have a look at our entire product range and become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and get unique benefits.<\/p><p>Curious? Simply order your Tough Nut Cream today and we'll ship it to anywhere within mainland UK within a few working days.<\/p><p><strong>Please note: All of our products are shipped in branded boxes.<\/strong><\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Tough Nut Cream  Over Ice<\/h3><p><em>50ml Tough Nut Cream<br\/>Ice Cubes<\/em><\/p><p>Add ice to a short glass, then fill with as much Tough Nut Cream as desired. Serve and enjoy!<\/p><p>You can find more recipes in our <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">Cocktails-Blog<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"29562b2d-d73d-4a10-83aa-0c0922c0fbca":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"dairy_free","content":"<p>Contains milk & dairy products!<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"08a702ee-31b7-4e82-b9f9-90592e4d2eff":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"Moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"Pouring Lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","caption","518e9061-ed9f-42d1-ae44-cf5200aee6c8","price","description","variant_picker","fd35310f-a903-4f2a-aa78-92f345583144","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_MAmPAM","97ce63d9-5477-4fed-a92a-335ffa45b484","recommended_products_xL8FAn","collapsible-row-2","collapsible-row-3","29562b2d-d73d-4a10-83aa-0c0922c0fbca","collapsible-row-1","08a702ee-31b7-4e82-b9f9-90592e4d2eff","collapsible-row-0"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"image-with-text":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"image-with-text-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"The Original Cream Liqueur by O’Donnell Moonshine","heading_size":"h2"}},"image-with-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>A flavour that has to be tasted to be believed. There's a reason our <em>Tough Nut Cream<\/em> sold out just months after it launched. Best served neat over ice, this decadent and silky smooth cream liqueur offers a totally unique Moonshine experience, perfect for fans of the finer things in life!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["image-with-text-0","image-with-text-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/TNC_700_Splash_UK.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-8ae9-84fae6d01566":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--17963898274060__f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-8ae9-84fae6d01566-1684837189c45d6eeb-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Your Moonshine, Your Way","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--17963898274060__f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-8ae9-84fae6d01566-1684837189c45d6eeb-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>We recommend trying our Tough Nut Cream neat over ice, to fully appreciate it's rich flavour and silky smooth mouth feel. It also works perfectly in any number of cocktails or as a wonderful addition to your favourite desserts.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"button_BqrgMB":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"Our cocktail recipes","button_link":"shopify:\/\/blogs\/cocktails","button_style_white_color":false}}},"block_order":["template--17963898274060__f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-8ae9-84fae6d01566-1684837189c45d6eeb-0","template--17963898274060__f1ea0866-fcfa-41f3-8ae9-84fae6d01566-1684837189c45d6eeb-1","button_BqrgMB"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/TNC_CocktailMood_UK.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium",